# Numba caches compiled kernels to .nbi/.nbc next to the source. Baking those
# into the image is a correctness hazard, not just bloat: a cache produced under
# different fastmath flags can be served in place of the current source, and
# this project's NaN handling depends on those exact flags. Always let the
# container compile its own.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.nbi
*.nbc

.git/
.pytest_cache/
.superpowers/

# Large artifacts with no business in a build context.
*.sif
*.npz
*.zarr/
yearly_metrics_zarrs/
output_zarrs/
